{"3863220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hypercore", "steam_appid": 3863220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TRAVEL ACROSS THE CORE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across over 20 Stages with unique mechanics, and diverse environment every step of the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863220/extras/4b5365ef0ae40d558a5f00ee00173d02.poster.avif?t=1786809366\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863220/extras/4b5365ef0ae40d558a5f00ee00173d02.webm?t=1786809366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863220/extras/4b5365ef0ae40d558a5f00ee00173d02.mp4?t=1786809366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAY WITH FRIENDS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to 3 Other People Online or Locally! Customize yourself with almost endless cosmetics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863220/extras/402c20647faad2244259a8ce74d0f262.poster.avif?t=1786809366\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863220/extras/402c20647faad2244259a8ce74d0f262.webm?t=1786809366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863220/extras/402c20647faad2244259a8ce74d0f262.mp4?t=1786809366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragr